/P 119 0 R
/E (The wording is kept direct and action-oriented to reduce hesitation and make the next step obvious. Overall, the CTA reminders are designed to shorten the decision process, improve user flow, and turn interest into immediate action.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
